title: "madenci"
abstract: "A minimal-code skill for coding agents: the smallest complete change that solves the task — reuse what exists, stdlib and platform first, no unrequested abstraction or dependency. Derived from ponytail. One SKILL.md installs into Claude Code, Codex, Antigravity, Gemini CLI, Cursor and the Agent Skills standard; the Claude Code plugin adds hooks that keep it on across sessions and subagents."
